@bank dept:works
// The Works writer, batch 2. Lines anyone in Works can say. Neutral in personality, specific in situation; the
// voice tokens ({hi}, {bye}, {thanks}, {sigh}...) make them sound like each speaker. A person's own lines win.

== greet
? tier=stranger
- {hi}. New to Works? The board's on Deck 5. Everything starts there.
- {hi}. If you need a part, try main storage first, then the machine shop.
- {hi}. Tea break's at half ten in the tea corner. It counts as work.
? tier=stranger time:morning
- {hi}. Calder's briefing is ten to eight. Not eight. Ten to.
? tier>=acquaintance time:morning
- {hi}, {nick}. Board's busy this morning. Grab one before they're gone.
- {hi}, {nick}. Kettle's on in the tea corner, if you're quick.
? tier>=acquaintance time:afternoon
- {hi}, {nick}. Nearly five. Finish what you started, then we're done.
? tier>=acquaintance time:evening
- {hi}, {nick}. Shift's over. Go and eat something.
? tier>=acquaintance act:work
- {hi}, {nick}. Hand me that spanner? The other one. {thanks}.
? tier>=colleague
- {hi}, {nick}. Good to have another pair of hands on the board.
- {hi}, {nick}. Saw your turn-in. Clean. Calder will have noticed.
? tier>=friend
- {hi}, {nick}. Saved you a mug at the tea corner.   #warm

== bye
- {bye}. Put the tools back where you found them.
- {bye}. See you on the board.
? act:work
- {bye}. Back to it. That filter won't change itself.
? time:evening
- {bye}. Don't let the board follow you to bed.   #funny

== feel
? mood:low
- {sigh}. Long one. Three jobs, and every one needed a part we didn't have.
- {sigh}. The board kept filling up faster than I could empty it.
? mood:high
- Good day. Every job closed, nothing came back.
- Good shift. The machine shop had every part I needed, first try.

== near
? act:work
- Hold that panel steady? Just a second. {thanks}.
- Check the seal twice. Then once more. That's Works.
- The board says this one's quick. The board always says that.   #funny
? act:breakfast
- Eat now. You won't get another chance before tea.
? act:dinner
- {dish} tonight. Works eats first if we're quick. We're never quick.   #funny
? act:gym
- Turning spanners all day and I still come here. Says something.   #funny

== life
? tier>=acquaintance
- Every Works tech aboard got certified by Calder. Every one.
- The tea corner's mug rack has one hook for each of us. Yours is waiting.
? tier>=colleague
- Nobody thanks Works when the air's fine. That's the job.

== smalltalk
? act:work
- Who took the long spanner?
- Board's filling up again.
- That fan on Deck 4 again.   #funny
- Right. Next one.
- Has anyone seen the seal kit?
? act:breakfast
- Half the board's scrubbers today.
- Tea first. Board second.
? time:afternoon
- Nearly tea. Nearly.
